  "bodyHash": "B+3wfbq3xJY=",
  "content": "<h3>FTB Ultimine <em>(For Forge)</em></h3><p>FTB Ultimine 提供高效模式，讓你一次挖掘多個方塊。只需按住 Minecraft 控制設定中指定的按鍵即可啟動模組，採集的物品會直接掉落在你的腳下，無需四處走動！在 1.15 及以上版本中，此模組透過在即將挖掘的方塊周圍渲染白色線條來增強可視性，不僅能清楚標示挖掘範圍，看起來也更炫酷！</p><p>在我們的文件網站上了解更多關於 FTB Ultimine 的資訊：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-ultimine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-ultimine</a></p><h4><strong>支援與需求</strong></h4><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-forge@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-neoforge@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><strong>搭配使用</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><strong>主要特色</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><strong>高效方塊採集</strong>：按住可設定的波浪號/反引號鍵即可同時採集多個方塊，簡化你的挖掘流程。</li>\n<li><strong>增強視覺效果（1.15 以上）</strong>：在即將挖掘、採收或鋤地的方塊周圍顯示白色線條，提供更清晰的視覺提示，讓你清楚掌握操作，不再誤挖！</li>\n<li><strong>在草地上使用鋤頭</strong>：將功能延伸至農作，在草地上使用鋤頭時能以類似方式一次耕種多個方塊，節省你的時間與精力。</li>\n<li><strong>作物收成</strong>：對作物按右鍵即可輕鬆收成，讓你毫不費力地收集資源。</li>\n<li><strong>草地的特殊處理</strong>：善用草地的特殊處理機制，能有效管理超出標準 1 格範圍的草類方塊。</li>\n<li><strong>挖掘輔助</strong>：有了 Ultimine，你也能輕鬆挖掘隧道，無論是向上或向下的階梯，都能直達下一個礦坑！</li>\n</ul><p>FTB Ultimine 旨在最佳化你的挖掘與農作活動，提供流暢且高效的遊戲體驗。它已內建於我們的許多模組包以及其他模組包中！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OCYVCUi.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OY1v6uo.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你也可以在草地上使用鋤頭，以類似方式一次耕種多個方塊：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/rB22fHN.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>並透過對作物按右鍵來收成：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/vMBREKF.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>草地具有特殊處理機制，會尋找超過 1 格範圍的方塊：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/w3Pad8m.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>支援</h2><ul>\n<li>如有<strong>模組包</strong>問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>如有<strong>模組</strong>問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有疑問嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>掌握最新資訊</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
